  "details": "Trying out the new alpha-release for Android I've mostly had issues with audio output. I'm trying to use Bluetooth headphones and I frequently have to restart the game for them to work. I've occasionally gotten the \"rejoin world to switch outputs\" message but not consistently.\n\nMy guess is that the Bluetooth headphones have a transient connection issue and that breaks the game's connection with them without triggering the output device switch message. I hope that rejoining worlds when you switch output devices is a temporary workaround for some internal issue and fixing that will probably fix my issue as well.",
